    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n288.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_1"/>as it is written in Thy Torah: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="8" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/genesis_8_1/genesis_8"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="1" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/genesis_8_1/genesis_8/1"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:genesis/8/1">‘God remembered Noah and all the beasts and all the cattle that were with him in the ark, and God caused a wind to pass over the earth and the waters subsided’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_2"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="2" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/exodus_2_24/exodus_2"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="24" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/exodus_2_24/exodus_2/24"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/2/24">‘God heard their cry, then God remembered His covenant with Abraham, Isaac and Jacob’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_3"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="26" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/leviticus_26_42/leviticus_26"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="42" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/leviticus_26_42/leviticus_26/42"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/26/42">‘I will remember my covenant with Jacob as well as my covenant <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n290.jpg" n="135"/>with Isaac and my covenant with Abraham will I also remember, and the land will I remember.’</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_4"/>And in Thy holy words it is written: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="111" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_4/psalms_111"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="4" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_4/psalms_111/4"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/111/4">‘A memorial has He made for His wonders, gracious and compassionate is the Lord’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_5"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="111" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_5/psalms_111"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="5" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_5/psalms_111/5"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/111/5">‘He gave food to those that fear Him, He will remember His covenant for ever’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_6"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="106" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_106_45/psalms_106"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="45" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_106_45/psalms_106/45"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/106/45">‘He remembered unto them His covenant and He reversed the decree according to the abundance of His kindness’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_7"/>And through Thy servants the prophets it is written saying: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="2" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_2_2/jeremiah_2"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="2" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_2_2/jeremiah_2/2"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/2/2">‘Go and proclaim in the ears of Jerusalem saying, ‘Thus says the Lord: I remember unto you the grace of your youth, the love of your betrothal, when you followed me in the wilderness in land <tei:choice><tei:sic>unsown’.</tei:sic><tei:corr>unsown’’.</tei:corr></tei:choice></tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/intro_8"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="16" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/ezekiel_16_60/ezekiel_16"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="60" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/quotes/ezekiel_16_60/ezekiel_16/60"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:ezekiel/16/60">‘I will remember My covenant with you in the days of your youth and establish with you an everlasting covenant’.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/zikhronot_verses/final_intro"/>And it was said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
